# The dev container's build context is the whole checkout (`podman build
# .`), and the Containerfile copies only these files out of it. Everything
# else stays out, so that output/ (the Flatpak build, about 1 GB), .git and
# the rest never reach a build, and editing them reruns no step.
*
!tools.txt
!extensions.txt
!install.sh
!claude-code.sh
!claude-code.asc
!mise-system.sh
!mise-config.toml
!host-command
!claude
